s, Bats, Drones, Fireworks, Flowers, Marquee Letters, Skydivers, or a Skywriter.  There are also four pre-set messages: Prom Proposal, I Love You, Marriage Proposal, and Baby Reveal. \n\nUser Notes: This app is intented to be used outdoors.  For the Bats, Drones, Fireworks, Skydivers, and Skywriter messages, use in an open area without a lot of tree or buildings.  Test yourself first to find the perfect spot for sharing the message.", "short_description": "The cost to hire a skywriter or put on a fireworks show starts around $3,500.  For less than 1/1,000 of that cost, this app offers similar experiences and more.  You can write a custom message up to 30 characters long in a eight different ways using Balloons, Bats, Drones, Fireworks, Flowers, Marquee Letters, Skydivers, or a Skywriter.  There are also four pre-set messages: Prom Proposal, I Love You, Marriage Proposal, and Baby Reveal. \n\nUser Notes: This app is intented to be used outdoors."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/skywriterapp/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Simple XR Apps", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/skywriterapp/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1384643154734029"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "P